section british citizen act is:

section assumptions is:

section improved readability version is:

a place is BOT if
    the english name of the place is "Anguilla"
    or the english name of the place is "Bermuda"
    or the english name of the place is "British Antarctic Territory"
    or the english name of the place is "British Indian Ocean Territory"
    or the english name of the place is "Cayman Islands"
    or the english name of the place is "Falkland Islands"
    or the english name of the place is "Gibraltar"
    or the english name of the place is "Hong Kong"
    or the english name of the place is "Montserrat"
    or the english name of the place is "Pitcairn, Henderson, Ducie and Oeno Islands"
    or the english name of the place is "St Helena, Ascension and Tristan da Cunha"
    or the english name of the place is "Sovereign Base Areas of Akrotiri and Dhekelia"
    or the english name of the place is "South Georgia and the South Sandwich Islands"
    or the english name of the place is "Turks and Caicos Islands"
    or the english name of the place is "Virgin Islands".

qualifying territory for a place if
    the place is BOT
    and it is not the case that the english name of the place is "Sovereign Base Areas of Akrotiri and Dhekelia".

after for a date with a second date if
    the year of the second date is a number N
    and the month of the second date is a number M
    and the day of the second date is a number K
    and the year of the date is a number P
    and the month of the date is a number Q
    and the day of the date is a number R
    and (N - 1900) * 365 + M * 30 + K < (P - 1900) * 365 + Q * 30 + R.

a natural person is born in UK if
    the english name of the val of the birth place of the natural person is "UK".

a natural person is born in US if
    the english name of the val of the birth place of the natural person is "US".

after commencement for a natural person if
    after for the val of the birth date of the natural person with commencement.

after appointed day for a natural person if
    after for the val of the birth date of the natural person with appointed_day.

the plus for a number N with a number M is a number K if
    K = N + M.

section expanded version is:

a person is a british citizen whether anything for a boolean if
    the person is born in the united kingdom after commencement
    or the person is born in a qualifying territory after the appointed day
    and the father of the person is a second person
        and the second person is a british citizen whether anything for the boolean
        or the mother of the person is a third person
            and the third person is a british citizen whether anything for the boolean
        or the father of the person is a fourth person
            and the fourth person is settled in the united kingdom
        or the mother of the person is a fifth person
            and the fifth person is settled in the united kingdom
        or the father of the person is a sixth person
            and the sixth person is settled in the qualifying territory in what the person is born
        or the mother of the person is a person P
            and P is settled in the qualifying territory in what the person is born.

